<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brush Wellman upped to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brush Wellman upped to buy.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonald &amp; Co said it raised Brush Wellman Inc to a buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Earnings estimates remain $1.55 a share for 1997 and $1.75 for 1998, compared with $1.52 in 1996.</p>
<p>-- McDonald said the 12 to 18 month price target is $26 a share, or roughly 15 times the 1998 estimate.</p>
<p>-- Brush Wellman shares were up 3/16 at 21-1/8.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
